{"id":"427be4d627513590","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-cartesian-morphism.md","title":"Cartesian morphism","display":"df-cartesian-morphism — Cartesian morphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-cartesian-morphism","aliases":["16-df-cartesian-morphism","Cartesian morphism","16-cartesian-morphism"],"display":"df-cartesian-morphism — Cartesian morphism","depends_on":["[[16-df-category]]","[[16-df-functor]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-cartesian-morphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-cartesian-morphism</span><span>Cartesian morphism</span><span>16-cartesian-morphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-cartesian-morphism — Cartesian morphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"25a281534aa42440\" href=\"?note=25a281534aa42440\" title=\"16-df-category\">16-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (函子, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fc49efccd7348d66\" href=\"?note=fc49efccd7348d66\" title=\"16-df-functor\">16-df-functor</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,Y)\">\\(f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,Y)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u=p(f)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(pX,pY)\">\\(u=p(f)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(pX,pY)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\">\\(\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p\\)</span> (本文件定义的笛卡尔态射谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}morphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}_{\\mathcal E})(\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Z,Y))(\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(pZ,pX))\\Bigl(p(w)=u\\circ v\\to\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Z,X)\\;(f\\circ g=w\\land p(g)=v)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}morphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}_{\\mathcal E})(\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Z,Y))(\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(pZ,pX))\\Bigl(p(w)=u\\circ v\\to\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Z,X)\\;(f\\circ g=w\\land p(g)=v)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 沿 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的因子，并且位于基底态射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 之上。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"25a281534aa42440","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"fc49efccd7348d66","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)$ (函子, see [[16-df-functor]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"u=p(f)\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(pX,pY)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}cartesian\\text{-}morphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{Cartesian}_p(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; \\mathrm{Functor}(p,\\mathcal E,\\mathcal B)\\land(\\forall Z\\in\\operatorname{Ob}_{\\mathcal E})(\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Z,Y))(\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(pZ,pX))\\Bigl(p(w)=u\\circ v\\to\\exists!g\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(Z,X)\\;(f\\circ g=w\\land p(g)=v)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false}],"bytes":1150,"backlinks":[{"id":"7b8e586c10f58d28","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ (规范笛卡尔态射谓词, see [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]])"},{"id":"4ea27d39c2af987b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$u^*Y$、$\\mathrm{Cloven}(p,\\kappa)$ 与 $\\mathrm{NormalCloven}(p,\\kappa)$ 由下文定义；$\\mathrm{Cartesian}_p$ 采用 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]。"},{"id":"83660625186c7ee3","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cartesian}$ 采用 [[16-df-cartesian-morphism]]，$\\mathrm{Fib}$ 采用 [[16-df-fibration]]。$\\mathcal B/I$ 与其箭头标签采用 [[16-df-slice-category]]；$T_I,S_I$ 是下文构造的互逆函子。"},{"id":"0ba8f021ca287877